Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:26.52,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}受到起舞的风邀请 去到坡道另一边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.59,0:05:32.26,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}无边无际的蓝 吸引了我的双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:36.91,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}发出声响的 悸动预感
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.97,0:05:42.81,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}隐藏的纯白心情 逐渐染上色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:45.29,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}来吧 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.36,0:05:50.71,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}与你 一起编织 未来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:56.30,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}就算现在还在摸索 还在迷惘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:06:01.60,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}描绘出 抛物线的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:07.69,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}七彩的明天 正在呼唤我们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.75,0:06:10.48,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}即使没有 路标
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.55,0:06:13.23,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}有不安 就一起分担
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:15.99,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}有你在 永远
