Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.59,0:22:19.51,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Kawaii Kaiwai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.38,0:22:22.72,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Kawaii Kaiwai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:29.94,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Kawaii Kaiwai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.65,0:22:39.25,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}鏡の中の 笑顔の私
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:42.84,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H990600&\3c&HE6FE86&}昨日とは違う 輝いてる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.91,0:22:46.55,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ドキドキしてる この気持ちは
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.62,0:22:50.35,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}君に伝えたい 電気のハート
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.41,0:22:56.88,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord0}新しい服で 新しい私
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.71,0:23:04.65,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord0}心も着替えて New New New New
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.72,0:23:09.33,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord0}Kawaii Kaiwai トキメキ感じて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.39,0:23:12.04,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H990600&\3c&HE6FE86&}キミからの返信 待っているの
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.10,0:23:16.62,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord0}Kawaii Kaiwai 胸も高鳴る
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.69,0:23:20.32,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord0}生まれ変わるよ キミと変わるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.16,0:23:25.28,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord0}Kawaii Kaiwai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.99,0:23:31.75,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord0}Doki Doki Doki Doki
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:08.33,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}可爱恰到好处
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.25,0:22:12.00,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}可爱恰到好处
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.92,0:22:15.67,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}可爱恰到好处
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.59,0:22:19.51,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}可爱恰到好处
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.38,0:22:22.72,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}可爱恰到好处
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:29.94,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}可爱恰到好处
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.65,0:22:39.25,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}镜子中 微笑的我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:42.84,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H990600&\3c&HE6FE86&}与昨天不同 闪闪发光着
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.91,0:22:46.55,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}怦然心动的 这份感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.62,0:22:50.35,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord0}想要传达给你 充满电流的心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.41,0:22:56.88,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord0}崭新的衣服 崭新的我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.71,0:23:04.65,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord0}心情也换上新装 New New New New
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.72,0:23:09.33,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord0}可爱恰到好处 感受心跳悸动
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.39,0:23:12.04,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H990600&\3c&HE6FE86&}等待着 来自你的回复
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.10,0:23:16.62,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord0}可爱恰到好处 心跳加速
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.69,0:23:20.32,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord0}我将重生 与你一同改变
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.16,0:23:25.28,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord0}可爱恰到好处
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.99,0:23:31.75,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord0}扑通 扑通 扑通 扑通
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.42,0:23:36.06,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,下集


